      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.52,
      "back_translation": "一路上我还得在一个小镇换车，因为每天只有一班直达老家的车。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9231,
      "back_translation": "换车的时候，我拖着行李穿过拥挤的站台，心里既有疲惫，也有期待。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9032,
      "back_translation": "最后一段路不长，却异常安静：石板路的两旁是低矮的屋檐和刚插下的秧苗。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
